# ---------------------------------------------------------------- build output
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
artifacts/
*.dll
*.pdb
*.exe
*.user
*.suo
*.cache

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- IDE
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- application data
# The runtime database and everything uploaded into the document store.
#
# These carry patient records. Even the demonstration set is a full clinical
# dataset - charts, notes, invoices, radiograph exposures - and a database file
# in source control is exactly how such data ends up somewhere it should not be.
# The schema comes from migrations and the data from the seeder, so nothing here
# needs to be tracked.
**/App_Data/
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# Generated claim files: X12 837D interchanges carry patient identifiers.
**/claims/outbound/
**/claims/archive/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- secrets
# Belt and braces. appsettings.json deliberately holds no secrets and every
# credential comes from the environment or a secret store, but a local override
# file must never be committed.
appsettings.*.local.json
appsettings.Local.json
*.pfx
*.p12
*.key
*.pem
secrets.json
.env
.env.*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- misc
*.log
TestResults/
coverage*.xml
coverage*.json
migrate.sql
